   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">09 February 2022, Rome, Italy - Aerial view of a cow grazing. Solaria Azienda Agricola Boccea is an organic and biodynamic farm. They cultivate vegetables, cereals, and wheat and they raise beef cattle. The products are certified by CCPB and Demeter, the farm breeds following ethical criteria</rdf:li>
