   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">29 May 2022, Male, Maldives - Workers processing yellowfin tunas at Ensis factory. Ensis Fisheries is the largest Tuna and seafood exporter from the Maldives. Founded in 2002, Ensis comes from the artisanal fishery communities of the Maldives, promoting its traditionally unique 100% sustainable one-by-one Pole-and-Line &amp; Hand-Line fisheries.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
